                    title:                  `The Servant Leader`,
                    subtitle:               `You were the best engineer on Atlas. Now you lead it. A client milestone is six weeks out, your strongest engineer is going quiet, two high-potentials were promised growth time, and a reliable colleague has started missing commitments. Empower or direct — read the person, hold the bar, and land the milestone without losing the team you will need for the renewal.`,
