                    chart_heading:          `Engagement, Performance & Turnover-Risk Trajectory`,
                    chart_start:            `Start`,
                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (a Polder partner & the team's voice)`,
                    coach_intro:            `Three things are true at once: the milestone will not move, the star is one quiet exit away from blowing it, and the whole squad is watching how their new lead shows up. Servant leadership is not soft — it pairs genuine care with a high bar. Read each person: a disengaging expert, two high-potentials, and a struggling colleague need different moves. Run the same playbook on all three and one of them will cost you.`,

